 "remarks": "A really special unit in one of Stamford's finest high rise buildings. This apartment has 1,646 square feet of space, 9 large closets, a balcony that looks to the east and south. Huge living room, dining room, kitchen with S/S apps, a large Primary Bedroom Suite with 2 closets (one WIC), and full bath. Two other generous bedrooms, one featuring 2 walk-in closets. All AC units recently replaced. Deeded parking space in garage. Heat, hot water and cooking gas included in HOA. On-site Superintendent, professional door staff. Sold As Is. Subject to probate.",
